          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "UL5rN",
              "name": "Heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "content": "Our story",
              "fontFamily": "$font-display",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "DgCzz",
              "name": "Body",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 18,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nqs87",
                  "name": "Paragraph",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Fencing Club began after years of travel to fencing clubs and training facilities around the world. Those visits revealed how hard it can be for athletes and clubs to obtain proper gear, whether from limited availability, inconsistent quality, or high costs driven by long supply chains.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "xkwRL",
                  "name": "Paragraph",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Those experiences shaped a simple belief: cost and access should never keep anyone from the sport.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "d4LGM",
                  "name": "Paragraph",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "So we built a dedicated, dependable place where fencers at every stage can get quality gear, backed by direct sourcing, clear guidance, and straightforward service.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
